"These are separate evidence dimensions, not one hierarchy letting models "
"replace compilation/hardware. Missing C/M/H/Q evidence is explicitly not "
"executed. Logs, artifacts, source/configuration and budgets bind the same "
"tuple."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/contracts/integration.md:63
msgid ""
"当前生产 SoC 包位于 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/` 和 `soc/stm32/stm32f1/`。 领域 "
"binding、实例布局与实现相邻。系列内部共享 IP 留在所属包内。 Board／SoC 不放 Python 插件；声明式 package 由 "
"`tools/configure/` 的通用 DataProvider、领域政策、typed IR 与有限静态节点解析，不再加载家族 Python "
"构造模块。顶层 `pads` 统一显式坐标；字段与同一快照合同见 [接入指南](../../guides/provider-"
"porting.md)。Native 仅在 `tests/support/native/`，必须显式启用测试 scope；不会进入生产支持枚举。 CPU"
" 实现按 ISA 位于 `arch/arm/cortex_m/` 或 `arch/native/`，公共头路径保持稳定。 默认生成入口连接 Core "
"的手写 C 整平台生命周期和所选包的 System／共享资源 C 协调器。 "
"主机保留事实校验与有限静态连接，不维护寄存器级硬件算法或驱动状态机；固定生命周期 调用与通用错误传播仍由 typed "
"节点连接，只维护一套配置实现。实际生成 factory、 C 模型与 ARM 镜像分别验收，不能用目录调整或源码存在 宣布整条链路通过。"
msgstr ""
"The production SoC packages are `soc/stm32/stm32f4/` and "
"`soc/stm32/stm32f1/`. Domain bindings, instance layouts, and implementation "
"live together. Shared family IP stays within its package. Boards and SoCs "
"carry no Python plugins. The generic DataProvider, domain policies, typed "
"IR, and bounded static nodes in `tools/configure/` resolve declarative "
"packages without loading family-specific Python construction modules. Top-"
"level `pads` uses explicit coordinates. See the [integration "
"guide](../../guides/provider-porting.md) for fields and the shared snapshot "
"contract. Native is confined to `tests/support/native/`, requires explicit "
"test scope, and stays out of production support enumeration. CPU "
"implementations live in `arch/arm/cortex_m/` or `arch/native/` by ISA, with "
"stable public header paths. Generated entries connect the handwritten Core "
"platform lifecycle and the selected C System coordination. The host owns "
"fact validation and bounded static connections. Register algorithms and "
"driver state machines remain in C. Typed nodes connect fixed lifecycle calls"
" and common error propagation, with one configuration implementation. Verify"
" generated factory, execution of model tests for production C, and ARM "
"images individually. The directory layout and presence of source establish "
"no execution evidence."
